---
const directions = [
  {slug:'collection',number:'01',name:'The Collection',description:'An editorial portfolio. Quiet framing, expressive type and generous room for the cakes.',tone:'cream'},
  {slug:'cabinet',number:'02',name:'Celebration Cabinet',description:'A colourful collection of occasions. Confident panels and a more playful rhythm.',tone:'berry'},
  {slug:'table',number:'03',name:'The Baker’s Table',description:'A personal, maker-led story. A slower pace, tactile details and space for the process.',tone:'sage'},
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" /><title>Cakeopedia — creative comparison</title></head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip">Skip to content</a>
<header><a href="/">Cakeopedia Austin</a><span>Working identity · internal concepts</span></header>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
  <p class="eyebrow">A website shaped around her work</p><h1>Three ways to<br />set the table.</h1>
  <p class="intro">Compare the same four creation slots, detail page and enquiry entry in three directions. Photography is deliberately absent. Copy, colours, identity and offerings are provisional.</p>
  <div class="directions">{directions.map(d=><a class:list={['direction',d.tone]} href={`/concepts/${d.slug}/`}><span>{d.number} / Concept</span><h2>{d.name}</h2><p>{d.description}</p><strong>Explore direction <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong></a>)}</div>
  <aside><h2>What to compare</h2><p>Which direction feels most like the baker? Which lets both elegant and playful work belong? On a phone, is it easy to find a creation and start an enquiry?</p><p>These are layout and flow previews, not final product imagery or a live order form. Appetite appeal and crop quality must be judged again with genuine photographs.</p></aside>
</main>
<footer>No live enquiries, payments, tracking or customer records.</footer>
<style>
:global(*) {
  box-sizing:border-box
}
:global(body) {
  margin:0;
  background:#f7f3eb;
  color:#302d31;
  font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif
}
:global(a) {
  color:inherit
}
:global(a:focus-visible) {
  outline:3px solid #765d88;
  outline-offset:5px
}
.skip {
  position:absolute;
  top:-5rem;
  left:1rem
}
.skip:focus {
  top:1rem;
  background:white;
  padding:1rem;
  z-index:10
}
header,main,footer {
  max-width:84rem;
  margin:auto;
  padding-inline:clamp(1.25rem,5vw,5rem)
}
header {
  padding-block:2rem;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:1rem;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  border-bottom:1px solid #ccc3ba
}
header>a {
  font:1.45rem Georgia,serif;
  text-decoration:none
}
header>span,.eyebrow,.direction>span {
  font-size:.75rem;
  letter-spacing:.12em;
  text-transform:uppercase
}
main {
  padding-block:5rem
}
h1 {
  font:400 clamp(3rem,7vw,6.5rem)/1 Georgia,serif;
  letter-spacing:-.04em;
  margin:1.5rem 0 2rem
}
.intro {
  max-width:47rem
}
.directions {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:1rem;
  margin:3.5rem 0
}
.direction {
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:2rem;
  min-height:24rem;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  border:1px solid #ccc3ba;
  transition:transform .2s ease
}
.direction:hover {
  transform:translateY(-5px)
}
.direction h2 {
  font:400 2.4rem/1.1 Georgia,serif;
  margin:3rem 0 1rem
}
.direction strong {
  font-size:.9rem;
  margin-top:auto;
  padding-top:2rem
}
.cream {
  background:#ede3dc
}
.berry {
  background:#572b3d;
  color:#fff5de;
  border-color:#572b3d
}
.sage {
  background:#e2e5d6
}
aside {
  max-width:48rem;
  border-top:1px solid #ccc3ba;
  padding-top:2rem
}
aside h2 {
  font:400 2rem Georgia,serif
}
footer {
  padding-block:2rem;
  border-top:1px solid #ccc3ba;
  font-size:.8rem
}
@media(max-width:760px) {
  main {
  padding-block:3rem
}
.directions {
  grid-template-columns:1fr
}
.direction {
  min-height:19rem
}
.direction h2 {
  margin-top:2rem
}

}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  .direction {
  transition:none
}
.direction:hover {
  transform:none
}

}

</style>
</body></html>
